{"about_the_game":"Humanity went out to the stars and conquered a significant portion of the known galaxy. While technology advanced society did not necessarily. Greed, the struggle for power and influence is stronger than ever before and while besieged from outside forces there\u2019s no lack of internal strife.<br><br>Follow the story of a young noble who is destined to marry the future ruler of the Empire\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521650/extras/b33550b7c994991d58a0a700e14a9d07.avif?t=1717774298\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>if he manages to stay alive<br><br>Meet new friends and enemies. Discover new places and find your own position on the board of an intergalactic struggle for power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521650/extras/359493147531d972ba5e9bae378db590.avif?t=1717774298\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Find out who you can trust and build up relationships. See if you can manage to live long enough to rule the galaxy one day.<br><br>You will take over as a young noble and discover a new world. <br>Visit different places and people and learn about the world around you and the state of the Empire. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521650/extras/40e84d4bfe5706bb2780a43e89951f47.avif?t=1717774298\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>But be careful, some of your decisions might have serious consequences for your future!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521650/extras/9d51f87854e70b029bfe64b8dd44d43c.avif?t=1717774298\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>This game is a western style visual novel where you are lead through the story of the main character and are able to make decissions over time by visiting different places, responding differently in dialoges to influence the ending.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521650/extras/ea228066764091dc2986b8a5a122d9f7.avif?t=1717774298\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>After finishing the game at least once, you can restart and choose an extended playthrough with about 50 new scenes and some extra characters to interact.<br>While the standard playthrough only deals with the story parts the main character witnessed the extra mode adds more context to the story. Events that our protagonist didn't take part in directly.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Life was short","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/e1319bc0bcba19a013d76170538d15a269da4d50.jpg"},{"name":"Canon was met","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/8d8f2f57bc9fb02d7dd17b0b689d327370801a56.jpg"},{"name":"Just brutal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/bb46b55b7118d8baacfa6b2bd8d1f64f5ec548b7.jpg"},{"name":"Who needs the army?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/3ac98db8e6b3b92e40b8f6e57c27ab6cf38a4d3b.jpg"},{"name":"Piloting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/38197110d0361805bc6435740b335bc14feba120.jpg"},{"name":"Knifeplay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/c929ee8aa0a1700177bb72c56327a847d246f8c2.jpg"},{"name":"Who shot the princess?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/390a5654688c5d550507e43f89e62e1d1e8baaf7.jpg"},{"name":"Double trouble?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521650/e2a887297eab0b1b85a2a3b09943b6e63bb0756a.jpg"},{"na